 "meta": {
  "title": "Siaya County geographic registry: county, constituencies, county assembly wards and sub-county naming systems",
  "compiled": "2026-11-21",
  "official_name_rule": "Ward and constituency names follow IEBC spelling in title case, as printed in Gazette Notice 13904 of 26 September 2025; for the three Ugunja wards (absent from that notice) the IEBC 2017 results report spelling is used. Codes are IEBC codes, kept as strings with their printed width.",
  "boundary_vintage": "IEBC delimitation of constituencies and county assembly wards, 2012 (in force for the 2013, 2017 and 2022 general elections). No 2024/2025 IEBC boundary review result was located; the September 2025 gazette notice still uses the 2012 codes and names.",
  "confidence": 4,
  "note": "Two naming systems are recorded separately and never merged: IEBC constituencies (electoral) and sub-counties as named by the county government and by KNBS census tables. In Siaya they share names one to one, but boundary equivalence is asserted by name only; it has not been checked against a KNBS enumeration-area map."
 },
